! CALL.DBG - the debugger's CALL command (docs/PHASE-42.md, subtask 1):
! arguments by value, the value returned, registers saved and restored,
! a breakpoint inside a called routine, and a call to a LIBRTL routine.
!
EXAMINE R0
EXAMINE R2
CALL FACT (%VAL 4)
CALL FACT (%VAL 1)
EXAMINE R0
EXAMINE R2
CALL HANDLR
!
! A breakpoint inside the called routine.
SET BREAK BACK
CALL FACT (%VAL 3)
SHOW CALLS
GO
SHOW CALLS
GO
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
!
! A LIBRTL routine, given MSG's descriptor by address (the default).
CALL LIB$PUT_OUTPUT (MSG)
!
! The program is still at its start.
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
GO
